.env

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/

# Everything a run regenerates: the warehouse, per-run rows, probe runs, experiment output, the
# `latest` symlink, and the layers an arm's patch builds from its base. One line, because they
# are one kind of thing — output — and telling them apart from evidence used to take six ignore
# rules and a reader who already knew the difference.
#
# What is NOT here: results/. That directory holds the curated, tracked measurements, and
# published essays cite it by GitHub-relative path. It is the one thing in this repository that
# an outside link depends on, which is why it kept its name and its place while everything around
# it moved.
runs/

# OS
.DS_Store
